BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:2026-11-28-the-mcdonough-band-annual-saturday-after-than-97d7db1@norwood.ma
DTSTAMP:20261009T121850Z
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20261128T190000
SUMMARY:The McDonough Band Annual Saturday After Thanksgiving Special!
DESCRIPTION:The McDonough Band Annual Saturday After Thanksgiving Special! Sat\, Nov 28\, 20 26 7:00pm Thanksgiving weekend always circles back to the same night at The Fallout Shelter\, with The McDonough Band on stage and the room packed full of old friends. Gerard McDonough\, Paul McDonough and Dave "Smitty" Smith bring pure\, unbridled rock and roll\, built on classics and songs from one of the area's most underrated songwriters. It's what the holiday should be about: community\, family and rock and roll\, all \nSource: https://grcpac.yapsody.com/event/index/876715/THE-McDONOUGH-BAND
URL:https://grcpac.yapsody.com/event/index/876715/THE-McDONOUGH-BAND
END:VEVENT
